---
pageType: page
useGeneralFaqs: true
title: "FAQ | Selling Your House for Cash in Gaston & Cleveland County NC"
description: "Straight answers about selling your house for cash in NC: how we price offers, what fees you pay, how fast we close, whether the offer changes, and when you should list instead."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "FAQ"
    url: "/faq/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Frequently asked</p>
    <h1>Questions we get asked, answered straight.</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      If your question isn't here, call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      or text <a href="sms:{{ site.smsRaw }}">{{ site.smsDisplay }}</a> and ask it.
      We'd rather answer it than have you guess.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    {{ b.faqList(faqItems) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Questions about a specific situation</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for s in situations %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="/{{ s.urlPrefix }}-nc/">
        <h3>{{ s.label }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.faq[0].q }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand() }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">{{ leadForm("bottom-form", "full") }}</div>
</section>
